'''Fragilis''' is an [[NPC]] in the [[Dwarven Mines]] that gives information about blocks in the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}}, {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}}, {{Zone|Glacite Tunnels}} among others locations.

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}

