== Trivia ==
*The name '''Fragilis''' is based on the word "fragile", itself being the etymological root and the Latin translation of the word.
*'''Fragilis''' has the same skin as {{NPCSprite|Keith}}, one of the {{NPCSprite|Three Bears}} before they transform.
*'''Fragilis''' does not mention all blocks mineable in certain areas (for example Diamond Blocks in {{Zone|Mines of Divan}} or {{Item|Cobblestone}}).
*Some entries within the '''Handy Block Guide''' lack a [[Block Strength]] : 
**For [[Ores]] and [[Dwarven Metals]], this could be due to an omission.
**For [[Blocks]], this could be due to the varying mechanics of the breaking system as they seem to lack this property, instead using the Vanilla mechanics of Minecraft [https://minecraft.wiki/w/Breaking#Blocks_by_hardness].

